{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23734","headline":"赠悼怀太子挽歌辞二首 一 · 白居易","name":"赠悼怀太子挽歌辞二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹马书薨岁，铜龙表葬时。\n永言窀穸事，全用少阳仪。\n寿夭由天命，哀荣出圣慈。\n恭闻褒赠诏，轸念在与夷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23734.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23734","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}